# Camera topics of the MoveIt Pro cell record_workflow_real (Audi), for
#   docker compose --env-file moveit_pro.env up -d
# The launcher numbers cameras in order among the loaded ones: Orbbec Gemini = camera0,
# RealSense = camera1, ZED 2i = camera2. Check with `ros2 topic list` in moveit_pro shell
# and adjust if the order differs.
WRIST_COLOR_TOPIC=/camera0/color/image_raw
ZED_COLOR_TOPIC=/camera2/zed_node/rgb/color/rect/image
ZED_DEPTH_TOPIC=/camera2/zed_node/depth/depth_registered
